Hello everyone,

Currently, our team consists of only 2 members. To further improve the quality and diversity of the game, we ask for your support for the project. Our campaign on Catarse is now live, and your support means a lot to us. If you'd like to support, check out our rewards: [url=https://www.catarse.me/TheSouthIsland?]Catarse The South Island[/url]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45029454/2fdafbee577516331f098b8ac77d27cc7b0bfe49.png[/img]

While we work on the full game, we are planning some new mechanics and amazing features that will take the game experience to a new level. Here’s what we have in mind:

[list]
[*] New mechanics for the main character;
[*] New weapons such as: Blowgun, Staff, Musket, Pistol, and more!;
[*] Teleport: Add a teleportation system in each village that takes the player directly to the selected village;
[*] Create a “HOME” map, where the player can build, renovate, decorate their home and items, and store their resources with an additional chest;
[*] On the “HOME” map, a small lake with a fishing system.
[/list]

We would love to hear your opinions and more suggestions for the game. Please, write to us!
Don't forget to play our [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/3135650/The_South_Island_Demo/?]Demo[/url] and add it to your wishlist, it helps us a lot!
